<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I would be desperately, constantly, patiently,</l><l>Drawing each breath of life from You, Lord;</l><l>Knowing that every day while I breathe,</l><l>Your life will permeate me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
